        ecrm:P41_classified  <http://data.silknow.org/object/c4eb2626-de2e-3b92-991f-62817e29510f> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/c4eb2626-de2e-3b92-991f-62817e29510f/category/1>
        a                    silk:T35 ;
